 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nAlbion Components Ltd                                         MASTER SERVICES\n14 King Street, LS1 4DY Leeds, United Kingdom                         AGREEMENT\nVAT No: GB557253505\nReg No: GB-639621\n\nFROM                                                             BILL TO\nAlbion Components Ltd                                            Albion Components Ltd\n14 King Street                                                   14 King Street\nLS1 4DY Leeds                                                    LS1 4DY Leeds\nUnited Kingdom                                                   United Kingdom\nVAT: GB557253505\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 02/02/2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Albion Components Ltd, with its registered office at 14 King Street, Leeds\n(\"Party A\"), and Albion Components Ltd, with its registered office at 14 King Street, Leeds (\"Party\nB\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of England and Wales.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A  Albion Components Ltd / Oliver Bennett\nParty B  Albion Components Ltd / Harry Whitfield\nDate     02/02/2026",
